WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.425
My name is Daniel Perry.

00:00:02.375 --> 00:00:05.238
I'm a Canadian Forces combat veteran.

00:00:05.238 --> 00:00:12.068
I served as a Signals Operator with Princess Patricia's Canadian Light Infantry, including a deployment to Afghanistan.

00:00:12.068 --> 00:00:15.488
I am not a journalist, a lawyer, or a politician.

00:00:15.488 --> 00:00:18.409
I'm a signals operator who can read data.

00:00:18.409 --> 00:00:25.988
After reporting misconduct through proper military channels, I spent six years facing institutional retaliation instead of accountability.

00:00:25.988 --> 00:00:33.556
I built this site because the systems that are supposed to protect Canadians are the same ones that failed me — and the data proves they're failing everyone.

00:00:33.556 --> 00:00:37.852
Everything on this site is sourced from the government's own published records.

00:00:37.852 --> 00:00:39.874
I didn't hack anything.

00:00:39.874 --> 00:00:41.920
I didn't leak anything.

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:45.431
I downloaded public data and connected the dots.

00:00:45.431 --> 00:00:47.568
Seven million records.

00:00:47.568 --> 00:00:49.534
Six databases.

00:00:49.534 --> 00:00:55.181
Five hundred and forty-seven thousand, eight hundred and eighty-nine registered lobbying contacts.

00:00:55.181 --> 00:00:59.181
Six point two million donation records since 2004.

00:00:59.181 --> 00:01:01.909
Every statistic links to its source.

00:01:01.909 --> 00:01:12.659
Every source is a public government record — the Commissioner of Lobbying, Elections Canada, OpenParliament, the Auditor General, the Canada Revenue Agency, the Canadian Legal Information Institute.

00:01:12.659 --> 00:01:15.409
You can verify every claim yourself.

00:01:15.409 --> 00:01:22.931
If any statistic, source link, or claim on this site is inaccurate, I will correct it immediately and publish a dated correction notice.

00:01:22.931 --> 00:01:27.568
That is a higher standard than any government department in Canada holds itself to.

00:01:27.568 --> 00:01:32.806
Seventy-six thousand, seven hundred and seven Canadians killed under the MAID program.

00:01:32.806 --> 00:01:36.624
One hundred and forty billion dollars in documented waste.

00:01:36.624 --> 00:01:40.318
And the systems built to stop it... are the systems that enabled it.

00:01:40.318 --> 00:01:42.488
That is why this matters.
